Error: Jet.TraitNotImplemented: `[U8:String]` isn't `Encode`
  --> Tests/UI/codec_impl_map_key_encode_refused.jet:10:16
    |
 10 |     print(json.to_string(by_byte) ?? "no encoding")
    |                ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `[U8:String]` would need to implement `Encode` before it can be used here
 Fix: A map's keys are text on the wire, so only a map keyed by `String` has `Encode`: use `[String: String]` and convert each key to and from its text
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.TraitNotImplemented
